      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The problem of stent thrombosis in patients with myocardial infarction is reviewed with consideration of possible mechanisms and causes of in-stent thrombus formation during first 30 days after the procedure. Roles of the patient factor, factor of the stented vessel, stent in self, stent deployment technique, and management after stenting are discussed."},
